# Known crossings of the crate layers, checked by scripts/crate-boundaries.sh.
# One `FROM → TO (KIND): REASON` per line, KIND being the kind of FROM's own
# dependency (normal, build or dev) that leads to TO. The list only shrinks:
# a line whose crossing is gone fails the check until it is deleted.
# See backlog/docs/design/core-contract.md §7.4 and §9.
pc-harness → media (dev): the FAT12 reader checks disks written by guest goldens until extraction
